        <item>
            <title>0.1.8</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 22:21:05 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>63</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.8</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>Reduced background window discovery while idle, with fresh discovery during active switching.</li>
                    <li>Safer sharing of overlapping discovery requests, avoiding duplicate work and lost request tracking.</li>
                    <li>Bounded accessibility calls when locating and focusing windows in unresponsive apps.</li>
                </ul>
                <p><b>Not notarized by Apple.</b> This ad-hoc-signed app uses a separately verified Sparkle update signature. macOS may require manual first-launch approval and renewed Accessibility or Screen Recording permissions.</p>
            ]]></description>
