        <item>
            <title>0.1.6</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 08:17:25 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>61</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.6</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>More efficient cached previews, shared window listings, and permission polling.</li>
                    <li>Less repeated discovery, grid, and layout work; preview timers remain active while menus are open.</li>
                    <li>Quieter automatic-update reminders in the menu bar, in English and Danish.</li>
                    <li>More flexible shortcut setup and safer handling of unavailable macOS window APIs.</li>
                </ul>
                <p><b>Not notarized by Apple.</b> This ad-hoc-signed app uses a separately verified Sparkle update signature. macOS may require manual first-launch approval and renewed Accessibility or Screen Recording permissions.</p>
