                    <li>More reliable same-app switching, recent-window ordering, search, helper-window filtering, and cached thumbnails.</li>
                    <li>Optional thumbnail controls, minimized-window choices, accessible actions, and privacy-conscious diagnostics.</li>
                </ul>
