        <item>
            <title>0.1.4</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 10:50:45 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>15</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>Default display mode is now <b>All Windows</b> — all open windows across every app appear in one flat list from the first keystroke.</li>
                    <li>Live switcher preview in Preferences → Appearance — see theme and layout changes instantly.</li>
                    <li>Welcome screen trimmed to launch-at-login only; shortcut setup moved out of onboarding.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
